CHAPTER.VERS:
And say to the Ammonites, Hear the word of the Lord GOD; Thus saith the Lord GOD; Because thou saidst, 

          Because you rejoiced when the enemy destroyed my city and temple.
         Aha, against my sanctuary, when it was profaned; and against the land of Israel, when it was desolate; and against the house of Judah, when they went into captivity;

Therefore, behold, I will open the side of Moab from the cities, 

          So that no power or strength should be able to resist the Babylonians.
         from his cities [which are] on his frontiers, the glory of the country, Bethjeshimoth, Baalmeon, and Kiriathaim,
